        "severity": "warning",
        "description": "Review the call returned by this Effect.sync callback. If it returns an Effect, return or yield that Effect directly; Effect.sync otherwise succeeds with the unexecuted Effect as its value. Keep native operations deferred and give them an explicit pipeline step.",
